Package: html2pdfR
Type: Package
Title: Convert Local 'HTML' and 'XHTML' Files to 'PDF'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lijin", "Arakkandathil Thekkathil", email = "lijin5673@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for converting local 'HTML' and 'XHTML' files to 'PDF' using an external backend configured by the user. The package includes helper functions for backend setup, file conversion, and an optional 'Tk' graphical interface.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
